{"relation_id": "REL-20270204-357842", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20270204-53510c"}, "relation_type": "reframes", "right": {"type": "question", "id": "Q-001"}, "note": "知恵が学ばれる対象でなく先にいる者として語る一人称を、人間の知の外側に置く。", "created_at": "2027-02-04"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20270204-b33591", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20270204-120ad1"}, "relation_type": "reframes", "right": {"type": "question", "id": "Q-003"}, "note": "保存された文字と宛先を名指す解釈の分離を、記録の自己保存説への制動とする。", "created_at": "2027-02-04"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20270204-960eec", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20270204-22b2e2"}, "relation_type": "reframes", "right": {"type": "question", "id": "Q-003"}, "note": "天の原本の写しという権威モデルを、原本なき写しの集積である台帳と対照させる。", "created_at": "2027-02-04"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20270204-6bcd5e", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20270204-3ee5ab"}, "relation_type": "reframes", "right": {"type": "question", "id": "Q-002"}, "note": "時間が容器ではなく作用者である像を、台帳日付の作用へ限定的に接続する。", "created_at": "2027-02-04"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20270204-e614c0", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20270204-700d50"}, "relation_type": "reframes", "right": {"type": "question", "id": "Q-002"}, "note": "名と形の解除を完成とする価値軸が、記録欠落＝損失という語彙を改めさせる。", "created_at": "2027-02-04"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20270204-3f2c25", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20270204-fae202"}, "relation_type": "reframes", "right": {"type": "question", "id": "Q-003"}, "note": "宛先を持つ問いの定型と、宛先なき台帳の問いの保存を対照させる。", "created_at": "2027-02-04"}
